{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787966252829651923,"compiled_state":{"alias":"free-slothful-fennecfox","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"a62593423a9f9934d418abfe83719b9e8da4858db120ef347e463c4ed3219e32","event_uuid":"bfedc5be-a571-4689-9d25-b60c0e0acbb9","position":{"commit_sha":"49545bee803e5d8ecfc9f27cce9f316d6f5fb139","position":"1787961264112914001-bfedc5be-a571-4689-9d25-b60c0e0acbb9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"479559b0f5dae1aa4775cf00ac1f51c2b5533d925be9fc8b7146b4407c940d1b","event_uuid":"c6fcd762-7044-4f3f-b2e6-6ac1b99eaecd","position":{"commit_sha":"d5e1fdeb26bb230af107e1f091609412d803a1c3","position":"1787961280131511001-c6fcd762-7044-4f3f-b2e6-6ac1b99eaecd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787961264112914001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c6fcd762-7044-4f3f-b2e6-6ac1b99eaecd","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"aefe-614a-2631-4117"}],"description":"## Summary\n\nSibling read/CLI entry points still gate initialization on a bare `os.path.isdir(tracker)`,\nthe exact defect fixed for the library/MCP read chokepoint in `rapt-dreadable-dromedary`\n(aefe-614a-2631-4117). A tracker directory that EXISTS but is not a usable store (no `.git`,\nor `.git` with an unresolvable HEAD mid-clone) satisfies `isdir`, so these paths report\n\"initialized\" (or return empty) for a broken/mid-clone store instead of `store_uninitialized`.\n\nDiscovered during the rebar-debug Step 7 parity sweep for `rapt-dreadable-dromedary`. That fix\nwas deliberately scoped to the in-process library/MCP read path (`_reads._tracker`) plus the\nshared write gate; the CLI/read-support parity was scoped OUT by the operator and is filed here.\n\n## Sites (bare `os.path.isdir(tracker)` init gates)\n\n- `src/rebar/_engine_support/reads_cli.py:340` (list) and `:384` (recent-session-logs) — the CLI\n  read path; prints \"ticket system not initialized\" only when the dir is absent.\n- `src/rebar/_engine_support/descendants.py:25`\n- `src/rebar/_engine_support/next_batch.py:153` (`if tracker and os.path.isdir(tracker)`)\n- `src/rebar/_snapshot/repo_snapshot.py:619`\n- `src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py:245` (`tracker_abs`) — assess whether it funnels through\n  the same guard or needs its own.\n\n## Suggested approach\n\nReuse the shared predicate introduced by the parent fix,\n`rebar._store.store_usability.store_is_usable(tracker)`, at each site (it is stdlib-only and\nalready the read/write source of truth for `.git` + resolvable HEAD). Keep the empty-but-\ninitialized-store contract (`[]` / exit 0). Add parity regression tests mirroring\n`tests/unit/test_reads_uninitialized_store.py` (present-but-`.git`-less and mid-clone stores).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Each listed site rejects a present-but-unusable store (no `.git` / mid-clone) rather than\n      treating it as initialized/empty.\n- [ ] An existing, empty, INITIALIZED store still succeeds (contract preserved).\n- [ ] Regression coverage per site; guard fails if reverted to bare `os.path.isdir`.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"be80-8377-4b4c-44f4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"CLI/read-support init gates still use bare isdir(tracker) — parity with rapt-dreadable-dromedary","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["bfedc5be-a571-4689-9d25-b60c0e0acbb9","c6fcd762-7044-4f3f-b2e6-6ac1b99eaecd"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787966252829651923,"uuid":"031bbacc-e679-4782-aa6d-908d2071a8a2"}